# Dalail al-Khayrat - supplementary text
# Format: T|title|author ; C|chapter ; V|arabic|transliteration|english
T|Dalail al-Khayrat|Imam al-Jazuli
C|Opening
V|بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ|Bismi Llahi r-Rahmani r-Rahim|In the Name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful
V|اللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى سَيِّدِنَا مُحَمَّدٍ وَعَلَى آلِ سَيِّدِنَا مُحَمَّدٍ|Allahumma salli 'ala sayyidina Muhammadin wa 'ala ali sayyidina Muhammad|O Allah, send blessings upon our master Muhammad and upon the family of our master Muhammad
C|On the Virtue of Blessings upon the Prophet
V|إِنَّ اللَّهَ وَمَلَائِكَتَهُ يُصَلُّونَ عَلَى النَّبِيِّ|Inna Lllaha wa mala'ikatahu yusalluna 'alan-nabiyy|Indeed Allah and His angels send blessings upon the Prophet
V|يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا صَلُّوا عَلَيْهِ وَسَلِّمُوا تَسْلِيمًا|Ya ayyuhal-ladhina amanu sallu 'alayhi wa sallimu taslima|O you who believe, send blessings upon him and greet him with peace
